      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIMBERLEY CURRENCY (10) has won narrowly his past couple, scoring in a photo finish over 1200m last time out in a strong performance. He was a track and trip winner two back and he remains down in the weights with Webster's claim. Has good early speed and will be tough to beat again. SIMPLY ROSSO (4) missed the placings two runs back then improved last start but found one better over 1200m at this track, beaten a nose after being prominent at the turn. Suitably placed so anticipating another big run. MARS MISSION (7) turned in a strong run two starts ago at this track then failed to back it up over 1205m at Roebourne last time, beaten 4.5 lengths into fifth. Looks better placed over this shorter trip so should prove tough to beat. KOTE (2) finished in the placings when a 1.5 lengths third on dirt at this track two back but then disappointed on turf last time at Belmont Park over 1300m when 12th. Well worth including back to dirt here. SHOOTING KONTIKI (6) won't be far away.",
